WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.938
Vijayanagara, the city of victory,

2
00:00:03.938 --> 00:00:06.281
was founded in 1336.

3
00:00:06.281 --> 00:00:07.901
Its ruins at Hampi are

4
00:00:07.901 --> 00:00:09.235
still vast.

5
00:00:09.563 --> 00:00:13.140
Harihara and Bukka founded it

6
00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:14.291
in 1336.

7
00:00:14.291 --> 00:00:17.812
The Bahmani kingdom rose in

8
00:00:17.812 --> 00:00:19.886
1347. In 1565,

9
00:00:19.886 --> 00:00:24.330
the Deccan sultanates defeated Vijayanagara

10
00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:26.099
at Talikota.

11
00:00:26.472 --> 00:00:28.552
Krishnadeva Raya was its greatest

12
00:00:28.552 --> 00:00:31.352
king, and a poet himself.

13
00:00:31.699 --> 00:00:33.827
The ruins at Hampi are

14
00:00:33.827 --> 00:00:35.822
a World Heritage Site.

15
00:00:36.498 --> 00:00:37.724
Your turn.

16
00:00:37.724 --> 00:00:39.658
When was Talikota?
